#
# Conformance case: full-fol/horn-equivalence
# AC: a Horn-expressible full-FOL logic:Formula lowers through the relational-core
# waist and EVALUATES in the chain — given parentOf(alice, bob), the universally
# quantified implication ∀x. parentOf(x, bob) → ancestorOf(x, bob) must DERIVE
# ancestorOf(alice, bob), byte-identical to the equivalent logic:Rule lowering.
#
# This is the hand-checkable case that pins the WHOLE chain (parse → lower →
# Skolem-free Horn extraction → canonical typed rules → chase → materialize), not just the
# unit lowering. The formula is authored in the reified RDF-1.2 logic:Formula
# surface (logic:forall over logic:antecedent/logic:consequent atomic
# predications with ordered term-carrier arguments).

